"The crowd offers a generous applause.":"La folla tributa un applauso generoso.",
"The crowd pelts {0} with a stone":"La folla colpisce {0} con una pietra",
"The crowd roars: +{0} CF.":"La folla ruggisce: +{0} CF.",
"The crowd roars: {0}.":"La folla ruggisce: {0}.",
